<title>USA: Pentagon sees no need for Kuwait reinforcements now.</title>
<headline>Pentagon sees no need for Kuwait reinforcements now.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pentagon officials said on Tuesday they did not expect U.S. infantry reinforcements to be sent to Kuwait at present because of an absence of new challenges from Iraq.</p>
<p>&quot;There doesn't seem right now to be a need for it,&quot; said Defence Department spokesman, Lt. Cmdr. Scott Campbell.</p>
</text>
